  "question": {
    "text": "A bob of mass $M$ is suspended by a massless string of length $L$. The horizontal velocity $v$ at position $A$ is just sufficient to make it reach the point $B$. The angle $\\theta$ at which the speed of the bob is half of that at $A$, satisfies\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/yB_mlfJxewK2ISXeI6nPyfMNBOljptoFdvbYpqzvEPk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "q6Eim",
      "text": "\n$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2kEVM",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\pi}{4} < \\theta < \\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mZQCP",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\pi}{2} < \\theta < \\frac{3 \\pi}{4}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "CgjOE",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{3 \\pi}{4} < \\theta < \\pi$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$v=\\sqrt{5 g L}$\nSolving Eqs. (i), (ii) and (iii) we get,\n$$\n\\cos \\theta=-\\frac{7}{8} \\quad \\text { or } \\theta=\\cos ^{-1}\\left(-\\frac{7}{8}\\right)=151^{\\circ}\n$$\n$\\therefore$ correct option is (d).",
    "image": null
  },
